    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "By default, this value is `true`, and a capture device automatically enables [`isVideoHDREnabled`](avcapturedevice/isvideohdrenabled.md) if it’s a good fit for the active format.",
      "ko": "기본값은 `true`이며, 캡처 장치는 현재 형식에 적합한 경우 [`isVideoHDREnabled`](avcapturedevice/isvideohdrenabled.md)를 자동으로 활성화합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "4d1ea4f4b412cd8cba695c92e8e27a68f61daf3d10d0c71cbbc112b2cd307a8f",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0001",
      "source": "This property is key-value observable.",
      "ko": "If the photo capture output’s [`isStillImageStabilizationSupported`](avcapturephotooutput/isstillimagestabilizationsupported.md) value is [`false`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/false), this property’s value is always [`false`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/false).",
      "sourceHash": "da10f6fb15a1291aedea3de21f0a99a0321c2e86790d0f3fd44477cca7d3c9a7",
      "status": "machine_translated"
